config BR2_PACKAGE_BUSYBOX_DAEMONS
	bool "BusyBox build for the resident daemons"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_BUSYBOX
	help
	  A second, minimal BusyBox with only init, inetd, syslogd and
	  udhcpd.  On NOMMU each process holds a private copy of its
	  binary's text, so the daemons that stay resident cost a fraction
	  of the full BusyBox image each (#23).
